$comment
	A dump cut off in the middle of a time (the simulator still writing it): #1 after #10 is the end of
	#1000: every reader leaves it out and reads the rest; a time that goes back before the end is an error.
$end
$timescale 1ns $end
$scope module tb $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
